01:32:12.802 --> 01:32:13.802
Hallelujah.

532
01:32:13.802 --> 01:32:14.802
En hoofdstuk.

533
01:32:14.802 --> 01:32:15.802
Begint hij dan.

534
01:32:15.802 --> 01:32:16.802
Met.

535
